@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-04  Recover access after losing email
' Requirements: ACC-04 ACC-15 ACC-16 NOTICE-02 DATA-01
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Account holder" as U
actor "Administrator" as A
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
note over U,A
User requests help outside a signed-in learning flow.
Administrator matches school-issued ID in person
against the existing account.
Another Administrator handles Administrator recovery.
end note
A -> S: Authorize recovery for verified existing account
U -> S: Provide replacement email
alt Email is already used, or Student address has wrong domain
  S --> U: Reject replacement and explain required correction
else Eligible replacement address
  S --> U: Request ownership verification of replacement email
  U -> S: Verify replacement address
  S --> U: Confirm address replacement; notify old address
  note over S
  End existing sessions and invalidate existing reset links
  before password setup, even if setup is abandoned.
  end note
  S --> U: Request own password setup
  U -> S: Set own password
  S --> U: Confirm password setup; require sign-in again
  note over S
  Preserve role, approval, activation state,
  progress, completions, and badges.
  end note
end
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-04 | Product behavior
@enduml
